{
  "schema": 1,
  "code": "hire-formalise",
  "version": "1.0",
  "title": "Ishga qabulni rasmiylashtirish",
  "source": "HR-R01, 2.1",
  "subjectKind": "employment",
  "board": [
    {"key": "docs", "title": "Hujjatlar"},
    {"key": "order", "title": "Shartnoma va buyruq"},
    {"key": "firstDay", "title": "Birinchi kun"},
    {"key": "after", "title": "Keyingi 5 kun"}
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "r01-2",
      "title": "Hujjatlar to'liqligini tekshiring (HR-F05, 2-qism)",
      "column": "docs",
      "role": "hr2",
      "blank": "HR-F05",
      "signature": "D1",
      "kind": "fact",
      "due": {"from": "case.anchorDate", "workingDays": -1},
      "completion": {"fact": "cand.f05Step:docsHr2"},
      "manual": {
        "allowed": true,
        "inputs": [
          {
            "id": "docs",
            "label": "Hujjatlar (HR-F05, 2-qism)",
            "type": "checklist",
            "required": true,
            "options": [
              {"value": "passport", "label": "Pasport yoki ID-karta"},
              {"value": "pinfl", "label": "JSHSHIR (ПИНФЛ)"},
              {"value": "diploma", "label": "Ma'lumot to'g'risidagi diplom / attestat"},
              {"value": "certificates", "label": "Malaka sertifikatlari (payvandchi, elektrik, haydovchi va h.k.)"},
              {"value": "workBook", "label": "Mehnat daftarchasi (qog'oz, bo'lsa) / elektron — mehnat.uz orqali"},
              {"value": "military", "label": "Harbiy hisob hujjati (erkaklar)"},
              {
                "value": "medical",
                "label": "Tibbiy ko'rik xulosasi (xavfli ishlab chiqarish va oziq-ovqat uchun majburiy)"
              },
              {"value": "photo", "label": "3×4 fotosurat — 2 dona"},
              {"value": "application", "label": "Ariza (ishga qabul qilish to'g'risida)"},
              {"value": "bankCard", "label": "Bank kartasi rekvizitlari (ish haqi uchun)"},
              {
                "value": "liability",
                "label": "Moddiy javobgarlik shartnomasi (omborchi, kassir, inkassator, haydovchi-ekspeditor uchun)"
              },
              {"value": "councilMinutes", "label": "Kengash bayonnomasi nusxasi (HR-4 dan)"}
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "guide": [
        "HR-F05 ning 2-qismi bo'yicha har bir hujjatni tekshiring va «HR-2 belgisi» ustuniga belgi qo'ying.",
        "Yetishmayotgan hujjat bo'lsa, uni nomini va topshirish muddatini yozing.",
        "Hujjati to'liq bo'lmagan xodimni rasmiylashtirishni to'xtatib turishga haqlisiz (HR-1 ga xabar bilan)."
      ],
      "sourceRef": "HR-R01, 2.1-bo'lim, 2-qadam",
      "link": {"screen": "blank", "args": {"template": "HR-F05", "subject": "candidate"}}
    },
    {
      "id": "r01-3",
      "title": "Mehnat shartnomasini tayyorlang va imzolating",
      "column": "order",
      "role": "hr2",
      "signature": "D3",
      "kind": "manual",
      "prereqs": ["r01-2"],
      "due": {"from": "case.anchorDate", "days": 0},
      "manual": {
        "allowed": true,
        "inputs": [
          {"id": "contractNo", "label": "Shartnoma raqami", "type": "text"},
          {
            "id": "term",
            "label": "Shartnoma muddati",
            "type": "choice",
            "required": true,
            "options": [{"value": "permanent", "label": "muddatsiz"}, {"value": "fixed", "label": "muddatli"}]
          },
          {
            "id": "basis",
            "label": "Muddatli shartnoma asosi",
            "type": "text",
            "requiredWhen": {"input": "term", "equals": "fixed"}
          }
        ]
      },
      "guide": [
        "HR-1 tasdiqlagan shablon bo'yicha mehnat shartnomasini tayyorlang.",
        "Muddatsiz yoki muddatli ekanini belgilang (muddatli — asos bilan); sinov muddati 3 oy."
      ],
      "sourceRef": "HR-R01, 2.1-bo'lim, 3-qadam",
      "link": {"screen": "none"}
    },
    {
      "id": "r01-4",
      "title": "Ishga qabul buyrug'ini direktorga imzolating",
      "column": "order",
      "role": "hr2",
      "signature": "D3",
      "kind": "fact",
      "prereqs": ["r01-3"],
      "due": {"from": "case.anchorDate", "days": 0},
      "completion": {"fact": "emp.hireOrder"},
      "manual": {"allowed": true, "inputs": [{"id": "orderNo", "label": "Buyruq raqami", "type": "text", "required": true}]},
      "guide": ["Ishga qabul buyrug'ini tayyorlang va direktorga imzolating.", "Imzolangan buyruq bilan xodimni tanishtiring."],
      "sourceRef": "HR-R01, 2.1-bo'lim, 4-qadam",
      "link": {"screen": "employment"}
    },
    {
      "id": "r01-5",
      "title": "Xodimlar ro'yxatiga (reestrga) kiritish",
      "column": "order",
      "role": "system",
      "kind": "auto",
      "completion": {"fact": "emp.hired"},
      "guide": [
        "Tizim o'zi bajaradi: ishga qabul «Buyruqlar» bo'limida yozilgach xodim ro'yxatga qo'shiladi.",
        "Excel ro'yxat faqat avtomatik nusxa — qo'lda yozilmaydi."
      ],
      "sourceRef": "HR-R01, 2.1-bo'lim, 5-qadam",
      "link": {"screen": "none"}
    },
    {
      "id": "mm",
      "title": "Mehnat muhofazasi yo'riqnomasini o'tkazing",
      "column": "firstDay",
      "role": "safetyEngineer",
      "fallbackRole": "hr2",
      "signature": "D1",
      "kind": "manual",
      "prereqs": ["r01-5"],
      "due": {"from": "employment.hireDate", "days": 0, "fallback": {"from": "case.anchorDate", "days": 0}},
      "manual": {
        "allowed": true,
        "inputs": [
          {
            "id": "topics",
            "label": "Yo'riqnoma mavzulari",
            "type": "checklist",
            "required": true,
            "options": [
              {"value": "machine", "label": "stanok"},
              {"value": "gas", "label": "gaz"},
              {"value": "electricity", "label": "elektr"},
              {"value": "fire", "label": "yong'in"}
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "guide": [
        "Yangi xodimga ish joyidagi xavfsizlik yo'riqnomasini o'tkazing (stanok, gaz, elektr, yong'in).",
        "Yo'riqnoma o'tkazilganini shu yerda tasdiqlang: platformadagi yozuv qog'oz jurnal o'rnini bosadi.",
        "Xodimning o'z tasdig'i (kod bilan) keyinroq qo'shiladi."
      ],
      "sourceRef": "HR-R01 3-bo'lim (taqiq), HR-F05 (ishga chiqish kuni), HR-R03 (1-kun); HR-01 1.5 (mazmuni — mehnat muhofazasi xizmatida)",
      "link": {"screen": "none"}
    },
    {
      "id": "r01-8a",
      "title": "Xodimni davomat tizimiga kiriting (Face ID)",
      "column": "firstDay",
      "role": "hr3",
      "kind": "fact",
      "prereqs": ["r01-5"],
      "due": {"from": "employment.hireDate", "days": 0},
      "gate": {"code": "Q02", "mode": "warn"},
      "completion": {"fact": "emp.attendance"},
      "guide": [
        "Xodim ishga chiqqan kuni uni davomat terminaliga qo'shing — yuz rasmi xodim kartasidagi rasmdan olinadi.",
        "Birinchi kirishda terminal xodimni taniganini tekshiring; tanimasa, terminalda bir marta qayta rasmga oling.",
        "Shaxsiy ishda hujjat yetishmasa ham kiritasiz: kunlari hisoblanib boradi, faqat oylik ro'yxati kutib turadi."
      ],
      "sourceRef": "HR-LY-3 (egasi qarori: davomatni HR-3 kiritadi, BonviHR Face ID)",
      "link": {"screen": "attendanceMapping"}
    },
    {
      "id": "r01-6",
      "title": "Xodimni mehnat.uz ga kiriting",
      "column": "after",
      "role": "hr2",
      "kind": "manual",
      "prereqs": ["r01-4"],
      "due": {"from": "employment.hireOrderDate", "workingDays": 3},
      "gate": {"code": "Q05", "mode": "warn"},
      "manual": {
        "allowed": true,
        "inputs": [{"id": "enteredOn", "label": "mehnat.uz ga kiritilgan sana", "type": "date", "required": true}]
      },
      "guide": [
        "Xodimni elektron mehnat daftarchasiga — mehnat.uz ga kiriting.",
        "Kiritilgan sanani F05 ning 3-qismida belgilang."
      ],
      "sourceRef": "HR-R01, 2.1-bo'lim, 6-qadam",
      "link": {"screen": "external", "args": {"url": "https://mehnat.uz"}}
    },
    {
      "id": "r01-7",
      "title": "Shaxsiy ishni oching va to'liq yig'ing",
      "column": "after",
      "role": "hr2",
      "signature": "D1",
      "kind": "manual",
      "prereqs": ["r01-5"],
      "due": {"from": "employment.hireDate", "workingDays": 5},
      "gate": {"code": "Q06", "mode": "warn"},
      "manual": {
        "allowed": true,
        "inputs": [
          {
            "id": "items",
            "label": "Shaxsiy ish hujjatlari",
            "type": "checklist",
            "required": true,
            "options": [
              {"value": "contract", "label": "Mehnat shartnomasi"},
              {"value": "hireOrder", "label": "Ishga qabul buyrug'i"},
              {"value": "formF02", "label": "Anketa HR-F02"},
              {"value": "docCopies", "label": "Hujjat nusxalari (HR-F05, 2-qism)"},
              {"value": "sheetF11", "label": "HR-F11 tanishuv varag'i"},
              {"value": "medical", "label": "Tibbiy ko'rik xulosasi (tashxissiz)"},
              {"value": "safetyMark", "label": "Mehnat muhofazasi belgisi"}
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "guide": [
        "Xodimga shaxsiy ish oching va majburiy ro'yxatni to'liq yig'ing: shartnoma, buyruq, anketa F02, hujjat nusxalari, F11 tanishuv varag'i, tibbiy ko'rik xulosasi.",
        "Tibbiy ma'lumotdan faqat xulosa saqlanadi — tashxis saqlanmaydi."
      ],
      "sourceRef": "HR-R01, 2.1-bo'lim, 7-qadam",
      "link": {"screen": "employee"}
    },
    {
      "id": "r01-9",
      "title": "Buyruq va oylik ma'lumotini hisobchiga bering",
      "column": "firstDay",
      "role": "hr2",
      "blank": "HR-F18",
      "signature": "D1",
      "kind": "manual",
      "prereqs": ["r01-4"],
      "due": {"from": "employment.hireOrderDate", "days": 0},
      "gate": {"code": "Q03", "mode": "block"},
      "manual": {
        "allowed": true,
        "inputs": [
          {
            "id": "payment",
            "label": "Ish haqi to'lovi",
            "type": "choice",
            "required": true,
            "options": [
              {"value": "card", "label": "Bank kartasi rekvizitlari berildi"},
              {"value": "cash", "label": "Karta yo'q, naqd"}
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "guide": [
        "Ishga qabul buyrug'i nusxasini ish haqi hisobchisiga bering va shu qadamda karta yoki naqd ekanini belgilang.",
        "Xodim ma'lumotlari to'liq bo'lmasa, u ish haqi ro'yxatiga kirmaydi."
      ],
      "sourceRef": "HR-R01, 2.1-bo'lim, 9-qadam",
      "link": {"screen": "employee"}
    }
  ]
}
